{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@3710","endTime":350413.946,"result":{"value":"All projects\nMOBILE EXPERIENCE / 02\nSimply Recruited.\n\nA recruitment-oriented mobile presentation built around personal profiles, discovery cards, and account entry.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nMobile apps\nFOCUS\nRecruitment & profiles\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nPut people at the center of discovery.\n\nSimply Recruited’s supplied screens place people and their profiles at the center of the experience. Portrait-led cards introduce discovery, while profile information screens support a closer look. The artwork presents an account journey alongside these browsing views.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Simply Recruited's original project material.\n\n01\nProfile discovery\n\nPortrait cards provide a visual way to browse people.\n\n02\nProfile details\n\nDedicated views organize information about an individual.\n\n03\nAccount introduction\n\nWelcome and sign-in screens establish the entry experience.\n\n04\nCompact actions\n\nSmall, clear controls sit alongside the primary profile content.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nRecruitment & profiles\n\nDeep navy gives the mobile brand a strong frame. White information panels contrast with large portraits, and short controls keep the discovery interface focused. The visual treatment remains consistent from the welcome screen to the profile views.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Simply Recruited.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n01\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n02\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n03\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n04\nINTERFACE SCREEN\n05\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT MOBILE PROJECT\nInfinote\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nNOTES & DOCUMENTS\nInfinote\nLOGISTICS & SHIPMENT RECORDS\nSilasync\nHABITS & ROUTINES\nDigital Habit Tracker\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
